if you change rigctl to send :

U Main TUNER 1    >   AC002;

U Main TUNER 0    >  AC000;

that should be very useful.

Because AC002; switches on the tuner AND then starts a tuner  (about 10 max)

The tuner is then left ON.

Resending AC002; does another tune.

Sending AC000; switches the tuner off.

